OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,FDrone footage captured by ITV News
OL,7,FMeridian has revealed the stark
OL,8,Freality of the impact of record low
OL,9,Frain and high temperatures across the
OL,10,FSouth.
OL,12,FThe Thames Valley, Hampshire and the
OL,13,FIsle of Wight, Dorset and Wiltshire
OL,14,Fare among a number of areas of eastern
OL,15,Fand southern England officially in
OL,16,Fdrought, as declared by the
OL,17,FEnvironment Agency.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
