PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,FJuly is set to be the driest month on
OL,7,Frecord, with England having just 7% of
OL,8,Fexpected rainfall, and southern
OL,9,FEngland seeing just 1%.
OL,11,FDramatic pictures show the grass on
OL,12,FSouthsea Common looking more like a
OL,13,Fsandy beach , while xxx has turned to
OL,14,Fstraw - are as dry as a bone.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
