OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,FWhile temperatures are cooling off
OL,7,Finto the weekend, and forecasters are
OL,8,Fexpecting some unsettled weather and
OL,9,Frainfall next week, it is not likely
OL,10,Fto deliver the persistent, heavy rain
OL,11,Fthat is needed to make up for the
OL,12,Fcurrent shortfall.
OL,14,FWith the Met Office's outlook
OL,15,Fsuggesting August could be hotter and
OL,16,Fdrier than usual, and warmer, drier
OL,17,Fconditions could continue beyond next
OL,18,Fmonth, it could be autumn until there
OL,19,Fis the wet weather needed to recharge
OL,20,Fsupplies.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
