OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,FSome 23 million customers are under
OL,7,Fhosepipe bans, just under 1,400
OL,8,Fbusinesses have had to stop
OL,9,Fabstracting water, and the dry, hot
OL,10,Fconditions have hit river flows and
OL,11,Fwildlife, as well as affecting crops
OL,12,Fand livestock.
OL,14,FThe harvest has come early, with some
OL,15,Fcrops such as cereals experiencing
OL,16,Fpoorer yields, livestock farmers are
OL,17,Fusing winter feed for livestock as a
OL,18,Fresult of poor grass growth, and even
OL,19,Fthose with on-farm reservoirs are
OL,20,Flikely to run out of supply during
OL,21,FAugust in areas in drought.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,FThere are warnings that the hard-baked
OL,7,Fearth will cause issues with
OL,8,Fharvesting crops such as potatoes and
OL,9,Fcarrots.
OL,11,FFarmers are calling for efforts to
OL,12,Fmake agriculture more resilient to
OL,13,Fclimate change, including making it
OL,14,Feasier to build on-farm reservoirs and
OL,15,Fflexible abstraction licences so
OL,16,Ffarmers can take and store water when
OL,17,Fit rains.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
