CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,F"We haven't had a drop of rain since
OL,7,Fearly June so that's really scuppered
OL,8,Fus in terms of the harvest."
OL,10,FIn response to the heatwaves and
OL,11,Fwildfires hitting much of Europe, the
OL,12,FUK and Spain have issued a joint
OL,13,Fstatement warning that climate change
OL,14,Fis "a national security emergency"
OL,15,Fthreatening people's way of life.
OL,26,@vD@DOUvD@bO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/9
