PN,38108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,FFollowing a meeting between Foreign
OL,7,FSecretary Ed Miliband and Spain's
OL,8,Fforeign minister Jose Manuel Albares
OL,9,FBueno, the countries put out a joint
OL,10,Fstatement which said addressing the
OL,11,Fclimate crisis was an urgent priority,
OL,12,Fto tackle the cost of living, protect
OL,13,Fhealth and wellbeing, and to ensure
OL,14,FEuropean economic and energy security.
OL,26,@pD@Urr
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
