OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785424693
OL,3,CDrought declared: The South's parched
OL,4,Clandscape from the air
OL,6,F"At a time when Europe is facing
OL,7,Frecord heatwaves and terrible
OL,8,Fwildfires as a consequence of the
OL,9,Fclimate crisis, the two Ministers
OL,10,Fagreed that this summer's wildfires
OL,11,Fdemonstrated that climate change was
OL,12,Fnow a national security emergency
OL,13,Ffacing Europe and threatening our way
OL,14,Fof life," the statement said.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@IO]
